# Community and account deletion need no custom server secrets.
#
# `delete-account` uses SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY and
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, which the Edge runtime injects automatically.
# Community runs entirely through SECURITY DEFINER RPCs, RLS policies, and a
# private storage bucket defined in supabase/migrations/0007_community.sql.
#
# Copy to supabase/.env only if you add a function that genuinely needs a
# secret. Never commit real values, and never place a service-role key or any
# other secret in the iOS app target or an EXPO_PUBLIC_ variable.
